+
+Review finding: `cancel` refunded in full at any time before the start, contradicting the policy stated in
+task-001 (cancelling under 24 h before start: no refund; otherwise full refund). This corrects task-005's
+assumption that no policy was stated: `cancel` now refunds the full total when the booking starts at least
+24 h after `at`, and nothing when it starts in under 24 h. Tests updated and extended (exactly 24 h, under 24 h).
